GPL-2.0-or-later terms.

The full text of the GPL-2.0 license can be found at:
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html


Third-party Libraries
---------------------

mxDOS links against the following libraries, which carry their own
license terms:

- DOSBox Staging (https://github.com/dosbox-staging/dosbox-staging)
  GPL-2.0-or-later

- SDL2 (https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL)
  zlib license

- opus (https://opus-codec.org/)
  BSD 3-Clause

- opusfile (https://opus-codec.org/)
  BSD 3-Clause

- libogg (https://xiph.org/ogg/)
  BSD 3-Clause

The above licenses are compatible with the GNU GPL.


